    "created_at": "2016-06-14T00:45:27Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-06-14T00:45:27Z",
    "body": "It is also necessary to have a media query to detect inline playback support. We added -webkit-video-playable-inline in iOS 4 too.\n\nIf we can decide on an attribute name soon then Apple can implement it in time for the actual iOS 10 release.\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
